    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Wonderfully located Penthouse apartment in most convenient town centre location.\r\n\r\nThis spectacular penthouse offers luxurious modern living on the top floor of this exclusive town centre development. No. 96 is a spacious 111m² (1,194ft²) apartment with three double bedrooms, two of which have en-suite shower rooms. No. 96 boasts a large open plan kitchen/living space with floor to ceiling windows leading to an equally impressive balcony. This balcony provides an additional 1,200sq.ft. of outdoor space, which wraps around the apartment and offers breathtaking views on three sides over the entire town and surrounding countryside.\r\n\r\nInternally the property has been finished to the highest standards and the décor is bright and contemporary. The apartment can be accessed via a lift from the secure entrance hall or underground car park with designated parking space for the apartment.\r\n\r\nThis beautiful penthouse enjoys an envious location being across the road from the town’s train station, Dunnes Shopping Centre and Tesco Supermarket. Gorey Town Centre is a mere three hundred metres away and all the town’s amenities are within easy walking distance.\r\n\r\nGiven its central location, this apartment would be an ideal home for those looking to downsize. With its easy access to all the town’s many amenities, three spacious double bedrooms and large maintenance free balcony, this penthouse could also appeal as an investment and would be highly sought after by the many young passing through the town."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall \r\nHotpress.\r\nKitchen/Dining room   5.7m x 4.4m\r\nRange of wall and floor units, cooker, induction hob, integrated oven, dishwasher, washing machine, fridge/freezer, wine cooler, tiled floor.\r\nLiving room                  5.4m x 3.5m\r\nDouble doors to patio, dual aspect, windows, tiled walls.\r\nBathroom                      2.9m x 2.1m\r\nWalk-in Shower, w.c., w.h.b., tiled floor, partially tiled walls.\r\nPrimary bedroom       3.4m x 4.5m\r\nWalk-in wardrobe, t.v. point.\r\nEn-suite                       1.9m x 1.6m\r\nFully tiled shower, tiled floor, w.c. and w.h.b.\r\nBedroom 2                  3.7m x 3.2m\r\nRange of built-in wardrobes, double doors to patio.\r\nBedroom 3                  3.4m x 4.1m\r\nBuilt-in wardrobes.\r\nEn-suite                       3.1m x 1.1m\r\nFully tiled shower, tiled floor, w.c. and w.h.b.\r\n\r\n(to included all contents if desired)"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
